      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "readers: open with FileShare.Read | Delete, map, check magic, version,\nendianness, length, xxhash3, then invariants (parent below child,\nparents never decrease, ids in range). any failure is exit 3",
      "roughness": 1,
